  "implementation_notes": [
    "The headline/Table-2 reprojection metric is the mean over every inlier observation; the equally weighted landmark mean is reported separately.",
    "A geometrically non-empty reconstruction whose last optimizer status is max_iterations is preserved per scene but excluded from Table-2 aggregates. Direct-GTSAM converged/stalled vocabulary is not fully equivalent, so this gate deliberately guarantees only the unambiguous max_iterations exclusion.",
    "Reference Eq. (9) uses every retained left event against every right event, sum Euclidean distance, with no overlap mask or subsampling.",
    "The in-tree LM passed the preregistered direct-GTSAM equivalence gate; backend.solver_backend records the selected path.",
    "No terminal offline BA or paper-unreported parallax guard is used in the paper_reference classification.",
    "True frequency error and CAD ICP millimetres require explicit authoritative manifest provenance; public TOPSPIN supplies neither."
  ],
